			<item>
				<title>consumes과 produces 조건 @RequestMapping에 쓰기</title>
				<link>https://ezaurum.com/2012/05/consumes%EA%B3%BC-produces-%EC%A1%B0%EA%B1%B4-@RequestMapping%EC%97%90-%EC%93%B0%EA%B8%B0/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 24 May 2012 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://ezaurum.com/2012/05/consumes%EA%B3%BC-produces-%EC%A1%B0%EA%B1%B4-@RequestMapping%EC%97%90-%EC%93%B0%EA%B8%B0/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://static.springsource.org/spring/docs/current/spring-framework-reference/html/new-in-3.1.html#d0e1589&#34;&gt;spring 3.1에서 @RequestMapping에 새 조건 두 개가 들어갔다.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;그 이외에도 많은 것들이 바뀌었지만, 일단은 당장 쓸 수 있는 이것부터.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;http://toby.epril.com/?p=1212&#34;&gt;여기&lt;/a&gt;서도 볼 수 있는데, 기본적으로 &lt;a href=&#34;http://static.springsource.org/spring/docs/current/spring-framework-reference/html/mvc.html#mvc-ann-requestmapping-consumes&#34;&gt;consumes&lt;/a&gt;는 header의 &lt;a href=&#34;http://coderant.egloos.com/3706282&#34;&gt;Content-Type&lt;/a&gt; 대체, &lt;a href=&#34;http://static.springsource.org/spring/docs/current/spring-framework-reference/html/mvc.html#mvc-ann-requestmapping-produces&#34;&gt;produces&lt;/a&gt;는 Accept 대체가 된다.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;이렇게 쓰면 된다.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;@RequestMapping(value=&amp;quot;/&amp;quot;, consumes={&amp;ldquo;application/json&amp;rdquo;,&amp;ldquo;multipart/form-data&amp;rdquo;,&amp;ldquo;application/x-www-form-urlencoded&amp;rdquo;})&lt;/p&gt;</description>
